# The Season of Discovery Divine Storm chain, back in Forever as a level 30
# Paladin chain for the Cloak of the Divine Storm: A Strange Artifact (78088)
# from the Strange Orb atop the Tower of Althalaxx, Advice From Stormwind
# (78089), A Second Opinion (78090), Earning Your Salt (78091), It Must Be
# Destroyed (78092) and Return to Delgren (78093).
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json (Questie-Forever)
# for givers, enders, objectives and the droppers of the Summoner's Salt and
# the Motes of Mannoroth; Forever's Paladin class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/) for the Forever changes:
# level 30, requires 22, starts at the Strange Orb instead of Delgren, rewards
# the Cloak of the Divine Storm. The Strange Orb is not in our data: its place
# (Darkshore 56.2,26.5, the top of the Tower of Althalaxx) and the mobs that
# drop the salt are from a news report
# "New Paladin-Exclusive Cloak Currently Alliance Only" (10 October 2026),
# which also says only Alliance Paladins can finish the chain for now.
# The tower's mobs from Forever's data: Dark Strand Fanatics (16-17) around
# it, four Dark Strand Voidcallers (28-29) in the tower itself;
# their Summon Voidwalker and Shadow Bolt from the Forever server tables.
# The chain is level 30 with level 22 to start: inside the beta's level cap.
# Mob levels, elites and respawns from Forever's quest data (the knowledge
# base): the north-west Redridge camp (Summoners, Champions, Trackers,
# level 22-25) is not elite, the camps east of Lakeshire are; the Demon Fall
# Canyon demons are level 29-30, not elite, five-minute respawn. Counts: 14
# Summoner's Salt, 12 Motes of Mannoroth. The data gives no drop rates for
# either.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Darkshore

step The Strange Orb
  tip Climb to the top of the Tower of Althalaxx in northern Darkshore. The Dark Strand Fanatics around it are easy (level 16-17), but four Dark Strand Voidcallers (level 28-29) stand in the tower on the way to the orb: each calls a voidwalker and casts Shadow Bolt from range. At 22-25 bring a friend or two, pull them one at a time and step behind a wall so they have to come to you. Loot the Strange Orb at the top: it gives you the Althalaxx Orb; right-click it to start the quest. Keep the orb in your bags until the Spear of Mannoroth: three later quests need it.
  level 22
  accept 78088 @56.2,26.5             -- Strange Orb atop the Tower of Althalaxx: right-click the Althalaxx Orb it gives

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ashenvale

step Delgren the Purifier
  zone Ashenvale
  tip Delgren the Purifier stands at Maestra's Post in western Ashenvale, south of the Darkshore road. He sends you to Stormwind with the orb.
  turnin 78088                        -- Delgren the Purifier
  accept 78089

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Stormwind

step Katherine the Pure
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Katherine the Pure stands in the Cathedral of Light; she sends you to a warlock for a second opinion.
  turnin 78089                        -- Katherine the Pure
  accept 78090

step Ursula Deline
  tip Ursula Deline, the warlock trainer, is in the Mage Quarter's warlock sanctum, down in the Slaughtered Lamb's cellar. She wants 14 Summoner's Salt to read the orb.
  turnin 78090                        -- Ursula Deline
  accept 78091

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Redridge Mountains

step Summoner's Salt
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip The Blackrock Summoners, Champions and Trackers (level 22-25, not elite) camp in the north-west of Redridge and drop the Summoner's Salt; you need 14. Two elite Blackrock Shadowcasters (22-23) stand at the cave mouth at the camp's east end: pull around them. The Blackrock camps east of Lakeshire drop the salt too, but their Shadowcasters, Sentries and Hunters are elite (level 21-24), and so is Gath'Ilzogg (26): stay in the north-west.
  collect 209778 quest 78091.1 @23.5,12.0 live

step Back to Ursula
  zone Stormwind City
  turnin 78091                        -- Ursula Deline
  accept 78092

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Demon Fall Canyon

step Motes of Mannoroth
  zone Ashenvale
  tip Demon Fall Canyon is in south-east Ashenvale, east of Splintertree Post (a Horde camp: go round it). The Mannoroc Lashers, Searing Infernals, Felguards and Legion Hounds (level 29-30, not elite) drop the Motes of Mannoroth; you need 12. Below about 27 they are hard alone: come with a second player or later. Felguards knock you down, Lashers cast Shadow Bolt and Immolate, Infernals keep a fire shield up. They respawn in five minutes.
  collect 209779 quest 78092.1

step The Spear of Mannoroth
  tip The Spear of Mannoroth stands at the east end of Demon Fall Canyon. Hand in the motes at the spear with the Althalaxx Orb in your bags: the orb shatters, and the Shattered Orb beside it starts the last quest.
  turnin 78092                        -- Spear of Mannoroth
  accept 78093                        -- from the Shattered Orb

step Return to Delgren
  tip Back to Delgren at Maestra's Post in western Ashenvale, across the whole zone.
  turnin 78093                        -- Delgren the Purifier: Cloak of the Divine Storm
